@startuml get-manager-consent
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/consent
caption CRB-39 · 약관 종류별 버전 목록. admin도 조회 가능

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ManagerConsentController" as Controller
participant "ManagerConsentService" as Service
participant "AdminConsentRepository" as AdminConsentRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/consent\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Controller: list()
Controller -> Service: list()
Service -> AdminConsentRepository: findAllVersions()
AdminConsentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT consent + is_latest\nORDER BY type, created_at DESC, version DESC
note right: is_latest는 사용자 API와 같은 조각(consent.sql.ts isLatestConsent)으로 판정
PostgreSQL --> AdminConsentRepository: rows
Service -> Service: type별로 묶음 (각 type 안은 최신 버전부터)
Service --> Controller: ConsentTypeDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 [{ type, versions: [{ type, version, is_required, url, created_at, is_latest }] }]

@enduml
